From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:33:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0991/3799] soh: rename func_8001E304 -> EnItem00_Dropped

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the action installed on freshly spawned drops: tumbles the item on shape.rot.z, curves hearts toward the player, trails sparkles, and switches to the grounded action on landing.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c b/soh/src/code/z_en_item00.c
