-void func_8001E304(EnItem00* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_8001E304: the action installed on freshly spawned drops: tumbles the item on shape.rot.z, curves hearts toward the player, trails sparkles, and switches to the grounded action on landing.
